      ],
      "image": "assets/images/67132/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Add spinach; cook and stir until wilted.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kHBob3Fj1JSTg_hMuwEqLTmzfic=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-67132-CheesyCreamedSpinach-ddmfs-Step2-3x4-6606-2-8feadb7710ef47c38890dc303bd0d06c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/67132/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain in a colander, squeezing out as much liquid as possible.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VI0KIwkjD318IIE_Xdx6JMXSvZI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-67132-CheesyCreamedSpinach-ddmfs-Step3-3x4-6612-2-0857d6b2c27b414a89c361fe1b30070f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/67132/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in the same skillet over medium heat. Add onion and garlic; cook and stir until tender, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C-G7jCBcgiFv8Eu9CQMRFQyfbh4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-67132-CheesyCreamedSpinach-ddmfs-Step4-3x4-6620-2-19944bd39d8b4f18b2936b8a9ef1a19c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/67132/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add spinach and stir in heavy cream.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8HAZej3UuWt-6IESR4du5_U-Bfg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-67132-CheesyCreamedSpinach-ddmfs-Step5-3x4-6623-2-7d395e4f421f4a4d9fabccfa6f38dcf4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/67132/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tear provolone cheese into small pieces and lay on top of spinach mixture. Stir until cheese is melted and coats spinach.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8FPzKL49cc-JVOJe3IPYdDdSzI8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-67132-CheesyCreamedSpinach-ddmfs-Step6-3x4-6624-2-18fbdabb4d8e4eb38dbc21afabf1b303.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/67132/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in Parmesan cheese. Continue to cook and stir until thickened.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ko74JA8mi1llD_F1Go42nM3AV48=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-67132-CheesyCreamedSpinach-ddmfs-Step7-3x4-6626-2-2e88a2ab34304812ac592bd570fc8c3f.jpg"
